{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/514d55bac6ffba3f5bd1e8451dc0f50910454b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = 100^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/2/fb217cd9e6d4765595cd556e32e391847f621306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B = 50^\\circ$\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e8412e08e2d449f2697107b7292d685f7f63d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/5605e7674254425ca5932c0a752f8a04b6b16770.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AH}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> is an altitude, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e0af598b1d12c1fc9164924f2c0ead5ea87f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BM}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is a median. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612c95b14572ccc7d1302ff50874efa2ea0e0065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle MHC=$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be12166f6bad06cbd79a52ef22f2aebb8e5ca7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(16,0)--(6,6)--cycle); draw((6,6)--(6,0)--(11,3)--(0,0)); dot((6,6)); dot((0,0)); dot((11,3)); dot((6,0)); dot((16,0)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (6,6), N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (0,0), W); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (16,0), E); label(&quot;$H$&quot;, (6,0), S); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, (11,3), NE);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"122\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306afab1d8f41c9b53a76f1caa54b6beee0362cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 15^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 22.5^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 40^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"449\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/24791c6149c9aa8fbbfe18258ce2b614e5ae569e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(16,0)--(6,6)--cycle); draw((6,6)--(6,0)--(11,3)--(0,0)); draw((11,3)--(11,0), dotted); dot((6,6)); dot((0,0)); dot((11,3)); dot((6,0)); dot((16,0)); dot((11,0)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (6,6), N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (0,0), W); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (16,0), E); label(&quot;$H$&quot;, (6,0), S); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, (11,3), NE); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, (11,0), S);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"122\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e0af598b1d12c1fc9164924f2c0ead5ea87f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BM}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is a median, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e837ec0144e73161a00ab7db5d6a79073eb30166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = MC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the foot of the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf97f3dbe87b5ed70cb56c5d7ebc66b87e68e9c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{HC}$\" width=\"31\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/3/7c3743e3766d37e5003cf7a7059ea5cc1e5c01b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN \\parallel AH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fbcd19b6528565f64c0c9f4c936be03cb36f5b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HN = NC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/0589fd3fbcc97d3345fb528f79babea037273ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MNH \\cong \\triangle MNC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/4/9c43a91ed2c772c925b351668f07f0665a3b4804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle MHC=\\angle C=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"212\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/4/64417acfe8647838193695cb07a948da232b5572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AHC$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the circumcenter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/4/64417acfe8647838193695cb07a948da232b5572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AHC$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08c0e9a3928057800c652edfa27726ae546c7a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MA = MH = MC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"154\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/f/e0fcc617dcc3a26d6bda05b1ece354e0df7a1d47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MHC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78a5eb25a81db743002fa8d49e147b2ad2571f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle MHC = \\angle C = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"212\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Prob